{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日、雨ですね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田は\n雨傘・日傘 兼用の折りたたみ傘を\n年中持ち歩いてまして"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"普段、日傘をよく使うんだけどね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"雨が止んで数時間経ったあとに\n日傘として傘をさしてると"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「あの子、雨止んでるのにまだ傘さしてるよ」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と言わんばかりの目で\nこちらを見てくる人がいっぱいいて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごく不快な気分ですよ(´・ω・`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2013/07/05/9685885/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"らりん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さて、\n今日放送の\n「ミュージックドラゴン」で\n『ガールズルール』踊ったよ(*´▽｀*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見るしか！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと、ナタリーさんで\nバック8の特集をしてもらってます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"順番に公開してますが\n中田のも公開されました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めったにないソログラビア！\n見てね(*´▽｀*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}